>TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133293159,imgsize-142322.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 1815, cats arrived on Ascension Island; they drove huge seabird colonies away]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133293847.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-1815-cats-arrived-on-ascension-island-they-drove-huge-seabird-colonies-away-until-conservationists-launched-a-cat-eradication-mission/articleshow/133293847.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/in-1815-cats-arrived-on-ascension-island-they-drove-huge-seabird-colonies-away-until-conservationists-launched-a-cat-eradication-mission/articleshow/133293847.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-17T17:20:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133293847,imgsize-103836.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Brass-making technology reached southern China through ancient sea routes]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133294697.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ancient crucibles found in Guangzhou offer new insights into early brass production methods.  These ninth and tenth-century vessels show that local cementation techniques were employed.  Residues indicate craftspeople produced brass locally rather than importing finished goods.  Lead-isotope analysis suggests local raw material sources were utilised.  The findings point to wider technological connections with the Islamic world through maritime trade.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/archaeologists-find-earliest-physical-evidence-of-brass-making-in-east-asia-in-southern-china/articleshow/133294697.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/archaeologists-find-earliest-physical-evidence-of-brass-making-in-east-asia-in-southern-china/articleshow/133294697.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-17T20:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133294866,imgsize-131000.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Houthis escalate Red Sea attacks: Ballistic missile strikes Saudi military ship, four escort boats]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133298716.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/houthis-escalate-red-sea-attacks-ballistic-missile-strikes-saudi-military-ship-four-escort-boats/articleshow/133298716.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/houthis-escalate-red-sea-attacks-ballistic-missile-strikes-saudi-military-ship-four-escort-boats/articleshow/133298716.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-17T19:17:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133298801,imgsize-20781780.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Watch: NYC Mayor Mamdani speaks Bengali while announcing free Broadway tickets for students, user says ‘your Bangla is better than mine’]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133298397.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-nyc-mayor-mamdani-speaks-bengali-while-announcing-free-broadway-tickets-for-st